4. Example genomes
------------------

Not part of the package. tantale_setup(install = TRUE) downloads them
in the archive tantale-genomes-1.tar.gz, attached to the release
genomes-1 of https://github.com/scunnac/tantale:
  MAI1.fa   Xanthomonas oryzae pv. oryzae MAI1, GenBank CP025609.1
  BAI3.fa   Xanthomonas oryzae pv. oryzae BAI3, GenBank CP025610.1
  PXO86.fa  Xanthomonas oryzae pv. oryzae PXO86, RefSeq NZ_CP007166.1
  BAI3-1-1.fa  an unpublished assembly of a BAI3 derivative,
      distributed for use with tantale.

The sequences of MAI1, BAI3 and PXO86 are identical to the cited NCBI
records (checked 2026-10-04); only the FASTA headers are shortened.
